1
00:00:00,648 --> 00:00:03,528
[SINGING]
Soft kitty, warm kitty

2
00:00:03,692 --> 00:00:06,192
(Sheldon:)That's for when I'm sick.
Sad is not sick.

3
00:00:06,362 --> 00:00:08,862
Oh, I'm sorry.
I don't know your sad song.

4
00:00:09,031 --> 00:00:11,871
(Sheldon:)I don't have a sad song.
I'm not a child.

5
00:00:13,452 --> 00:00:16,952
(Penny:)Well, you know, I do understand
what you're going through.

6
00:00:17,122 --> 00:00:19,712
Really? Did you have
the Nobel Prize in waitressing...

7
00:00:19,875 --> 00:00:21,665
(Sheldon:)...stolen from you?

8
00:00:22,461 --> 00:00:23,921
(Penny:)Well, no.

9
00:00:24,088 --> 00:00:26,838
But, uh, when I was in high school,
one of my friends heard...

10
00:00:27,007 --> 00:00:30,137
...I was gonna be named
head cheerleader. I was so excited.

11
00:00:30,302 --> 00:00:33,222
(Penny:)My mom even made me
a celebration pie.

12
00:00:33,389 --> 00:00:36,179
(Penny:)Then they named stupid
Valerie Mosbacher head cheerleader.

13
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:38,480
Big old slutbag.

14
00:00:39,687 --> 00:00:43,107
(Sheldon:)Are you saying
that you think a celebration pie...

15
00:00:43,274 --> 00:00:46,564
(Sheldon:)...is even remotely comparable
to a Nobel Prize?

16
00:00:46,735 --> 00:00:49,615
(Penny:)Well, they're pretty tasty.

17
00:00:51,198 --> 00:00:54,118
(Sheldon:)And on a different
but not unrelated topic...

18
00:00:54,285 --> 00:00:57,035
(Sheldon:)...based on your current efforts
to buoy my spirits...

